  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "美麗之島有一條路"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>李鈺凰</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">美麗之島有一條路</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">45冬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頂面滿碎石尖bi-bi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">汗、血、目屎sì-kè是</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生狂tshuê仔亂亂khà</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無thang阻擋仝跤跡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行向前方——</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā lán ê旗仔攑kuân-kuân　he是lán ê火把！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā lán ê手燈攑kuân-kuân　he是lán ê火把！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">同齊kā lán手頭ê字句　攑kuân-kuân tshînn風thián翼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就算講tī烏暗暝失去方向</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">翼股tsiâu是美麗島ê精神kah堅強</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄驚雨冷風透liam-mi起飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自由人民做主ê大條街</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是lán飛--過tsiah ē開ê花</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">作者註：筆者tàu主辦「耶誕青鳥：高雄大路過4.0」ê事工，tsit个活動是針對2024年12--月國民黨koh一擺烏白亂舞ê狀況來出聲。阮拄好辦tī美麗島hit搭，發現kah美麗島事件仝款lóng tī 12--月，而且已經45冬--ah，有一種45冬前後kah歷史有連結ê感覺。尤其是tsit擺行動，濟濟少年人是韓國偶像ê迷眾，知影政治kah娛樂有牽連，in手攑手燈來表達對民主自由ê守護，對照45冬前ê前輩in攑--ê是火把，有一種傳承ê感覺，就用文字kā記錄--落-來。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0j9LI6temnGzbYrxGaHNlMhiB0Op-P64xOm5KdAKKwA1U6BY_ZEy1Y8kQg8C87I9vxD8bVwbwDiAuogIj2F7zOVAHDKNBvwIOEQ1exPBhnTgyRJR7N95kbJJT2Wu1oEUEbm3Dz3QCDa0LJqYHg1fr6JlsT1eg0OWAshfqZZrD7zYFc8djCV7isjoOB7B0/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_23.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0j9LI6temnGzbYrxGaHNlMhiB0Op-P64xOm5KdAKKwA1U6BY_ZEy1Y8kQg8C87I9vxD8bVwbwDiAuogIj2F7zOVAHDKNBvwIOEQ1exPBhnTgyRJR7N95kbJJT2Wu1oEUEbm3Dz3QCDa0LJqYHg1fr6JlsT1eg0OWAshfqZZrD7zYFc8djCV7isjoOB7B0/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_23.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" sr